# Backend Laravel Rules

## File placement

```
app/
  Http/Controllers/     → thin controllers
  Http/Requests/          → validation + authorize
  Services/               → business workflows
  Actions/                → single commands
  Repositories/           → complex queries (optional)
  Models/                 → Eloquent only
  Policies/               → authorization
  Data/                   → DTOs (optional)
```

## Controller template

```php
public function store(StoreFamilyRequest $request, StoreFamilyAction $action): RedirectResponse
{
    $action->execute($request->validated());

    return redirect()->route('families.index');
}
```

## Model rules

- Use `#[Fillable]`, typed `@property`, and `casts()` method.
- Relations as typed methods; use scopes for repeated filters.
- No `$request`, no `redirect()`, no `Inertia::`.

## New feature checklist

1. Migration + Model + Factory
2. Form Request(s)
3. Action or Service
4. Controller method
5. Route in `web.php`
6. Inertia page (if UI)

Register bindings in `AppServiceProvider` when using interfaces.
